# Several cuts of one block in one pass: the parts keep its frequency and its handler
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: split-block function=f0 block=b1 indexes=0,2,5
# RUN(COVERED): split-block function=f1 block=b0 indexes=1,2

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js"
function f0 name="cuts" parameters=[{type=boolean}, {type=number}] results=[{type=number}] {
  b0(v0: boolean, v1: number):
    Branch v0 -> taken b1(v1), notTaken b2()
  b1(v2) frequency=Unlikely:
    v3 = Add v2, v2
    v4 = Add v3, v2
    v5 = Add v4, v3
    v6 = Add v5, v4
    v7 = Add v6, v5
    Jump -> next b3(v7)
  b2():
    Jump -> next b3(v1)
  b3(v8):
    Return v8
}
function f1 name="coveredBlock" parameters=[{type=anything}, {type=number}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything, v1: number) handler=b1(v1):
    v2 = Add v1, v1
    v3 = Call v0, -, v2
    Return v3
  b1(v4) role=CatchHandler:
    v5 = CatchValue
    Return v5
}
# CHECK: function f0
# CHECK-NOT: handler=
# CHECK: Branch v0 -> taken b1(v1), notTaken b2()
# CHECK-NEXT: b1(v2: number) frequency=Unlikely:
# CHECK-NEXT: Jump -> next [[A]]()
# CHECK-NEXT: b2():
# CHECK-NEXT: Jump -> next b3(v1)
# CHECK-NEXT: b3(v8: number):
# CHECK-NEXT: Return v8
# CHECK-NEXT: [[A]]() frequency=Unlikely:
# CHECK-NEXT: v3: number = Add v2, v2
# CHECK-NEXT: v4: number = Add v3, v2
# CHECK-NEXT: Jump -> next [[B]]()
# CHECK-NEXT: [[B]]() frequency=Unlikely:
# CHECK-NEXT: v5: number = Add v4, v3
# CHECK-NEXT: v6: number = Add v5, v4
# CHECK-NEXT: v7: number = Add v6, v5
# CHECK-NEXT: Jump -> next [[C]]()
# CHECK-NEXT: [[C]]() frequency=Unlikely:
# CHECK-NEXT: Jump -> next b3(v7)
# CHECK-NEXT: }
# COVERED: function f1
# COVERED-NEXT: b0(v0: anything, v1: number) handler=b1(v1):
# COVERED-NEXT: v2: number = Add v1, v1
# COVERED-NEXT: Jump -> next [[A]]()
# COVERED-NEXT: b1(v4: number) role=CatchHandler:
# COVERED-NEXT: v5: anything = CatchValue
# COVERED-NEXT: Return v5
# COVERED-NEXT: [[A]]() handler=b1(v1):
# COVERED-NEXT: v3: anything = Call v0, -, v2
# COVERED-NEXT: Jump -> next [[B]]()
# COVERED-NEXT: [[B]]() handler=b1(v1):
# COVERED-NEXT: Return v3
# COVERED-NEXT: }
